  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to PCKK for promotion of JCM in Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint Crediting Mechanism is an initiative of the Government of Japan to support climate Action in line with the Paris Agreement. It fits within article 6.1 which recognises ITMOs for climate Change mitigation. A Japanese Consulting Group (PCKK) has been commissioned by the Government of Japan to promote JCM and to identify RE projects that could benefit from the financing and technical support. PCKK is the lead PAC WA will be the local consultant to support the promotion of JCM in Senegal.</narrative>
  </description>
